  "title": "Ebola Alert in Kinshasa: Nearly 200 Boat Passengers Quarantined After Suspected Case",
  "summary": "Health officials in the Democratic Republic of Congo have launched urgent monitoring efforts after a suspected Ebola-related death involving a passenger who travelled by boat toward Kinshasa. Nearly 200 people who were on board the vessel have been placed under quarantine while authorities conduct tests and track possible exposure. The incident has raised concerns because the passenger travelled from an area affected by the Ebola outbreak before reaching the region near Congo’s capital city. Al",
